    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="0972" n="866" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg866"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Guatemalan
                            Legation to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Guatemala</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic">October 22,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Most Excellent Sir</hi>: Licentiate Don Jorge Muñoz
                    envoy extraordinario and minister plenipotentiary of the Republic of Guatemala
                    to your excellency’s Government, died in this city at 12 m. on the 22d day of
                    the current month.</p>
                <p>In accomplishing the painful duty of informing your excellency of the death of
                    Mr. Muñoz, I beg you to accept the assurances of my highest consideration and
                    appreciation, with which I subscribe myself your most devoted and faithful
                    servant.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Bengoechea</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of the Legation.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
